 "remarks": "Welcome to Highview East! This spacious end-unit townhouse offers two generous bedrooms, a private entrance, reserved parking, and access to a community pool and clubhouse-all with an affordable HOA fee that makes the amenities an especially appealing value in Norwalk. The main level features a generous living room, separate dining area, and updated eat-in kitchen with ample cabinetry and counter space. Recent improvements include a new stove and microwave (2022), energy-efficient dishwasher (2025), updated half bath, and a private deck perfect for dining, morning coffee, or relaxing outdoors. Upstairs, both bedrooms offer comfortable space and vinyl flooring installed in 2022. The primary bedroom includes three closets, while a spacious pull-down attic provides additional storage. An updated full bath and side-by-side washer and dryer, replaced in 2022, add everyday convenience. A new energy-efficient water heater with leak sensor was installed in 2023, and all three ceiling fans and lights have also been replaced. Central air and forced hot-air heat round out the home's practical features. The large in-ground pool and clubhouse are standout amenities, especially with such a low HOA fee for Fairfield County. Water, grounds maintenance, trash, snow removal, and pool service are included. Close to shopping, restaurants, parks, train service, SoNo, Calf Pasture Beach, and I-95, this home offers comfort, convenience, and value in a well-located Norwalk community.",
